WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.936
Confirm the exact school and record. This uses the real app editor with synthetic training records. Check the school, family or employee before changing a field.

00:00:10.936 --> 00:00:21.872
Review the selected child and rate. Each sibling has an individual assignment. A school rate alone does not assign tuition to a child.

00:00:21.872 --> 00:00:32.808
Check the cadence and first service week. Review the approved billing cycle and the first service period. Check for an existing invoice before creating anything new.

00:00:32.808 --> 00:00:45.660
Review an approved recurring discount. This synthetic example adds a $25 weekly family discount. Review the net invoice amount; a one-week exception belongs in One-time fee / credit.

00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:57.388
Review before saving. In normal use, save the assignment and verify the child rate and family total. This does not itself enable autopay or prove that an invoice was created.

